    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "At 4 life facing a Sunpearl Kirin (2/1 flyer), casting a second Enduring Curiosity when Kaito Bane of Nightmares was available is a significant mistake. Kaito provides a 3/4 hexproof body during their turn, and crucially its -2 ability can tap and put 2 stun counters on the Sunpearl Kirin, neutralizing the aerial threat for multiple turns. Additionally, Enduring Curiosity has flash and could have been held for the opponent's turn.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Enduring Curiosity (a second copy, redundant card draw) in precombat main phase",
      "better_line": "Cast Kaito, Bane of Nightmares to get a 3/4 hexproof body and use the -2 to stun Sunpearl Kirin, protecting their 4 life total from the flying threat",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 170,
      "player": "GPT5m Rivals",
      "decision_index": 137,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Quantum Riddler for its full cost of {3}{U}{U} (5 mana) when the Warp alternative cost of {1}{U} (2 mana) was available, wasting 3 mana for no benefit. Both options put the same 4/6 flyer on the battlefield with the same ETB trigger. The saved mana could have been used for Grim Bauble's activated ability or kept open for future flexibility.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Quantum Riddler for full cost {3}{U}{U}",
      "better_line": "Cast Quantum Riddler with Warp {1}{U}, saving 3 mana while achieving the same board result. Could then activate Grim Bauble's surveil ability ({2}{B}, {T}, sacrifice) with the remaining mana for additional card selection.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 175,
      "player": "Haiku Analyst",
      "decision_index": 139,
    }
  ],
